Object Class: Euclid

Special Containment procedures: SCP-5156 need to be contained in a locked room dimensions of 10 and 9 feet except for testing procedures. Clearance of level 4 personnel may enter it's containment.

Description: SCP-5156 is a humanoid scp which has power of getting ignored especially for scp's. This effect doesn't seem to work on humans. The SCP foundation get to know it's power on a cleaning session of SCP-173's containment

Origin: On a cleaning session of SCP-173's Containment SCP-5156 entered along with another two D-Class personnel. Unfortunately the power went out the researchers heard two crunching of necks.

The personnel managed to get power back on they see SCP-5156 crouching in fear as SCP-173 starred at it. The researchers were shocked to see this as SCP-5156 was asked to come out

Addendum: As the incident has shocked the researchers but also it made them curious to see what happens if they tested it with other scp's. This SCP handled by Dr.Rivian he is an unstoppable researchers if he started nothing can stop him.

This not only it's power it's true power revealed at SCP-173's Containment breach. Dr.Martha a female researcher who worked near SCP-173's Containment.

That day the gates of SCP-173's chamber opened SCP-173 moves towards the Dr but suddenly SCP-5156 appeared and attacked SCP-173 by grabbing it's throat and throwing it down

